<description>&lt;p&gt;ELN guerrillas have intensified drone attacks on Colombian army bases in the north, killing three soldiers and wounding dozens, including a strike on a base in Santa Rosa del Sur. The group is also expanding its cocaine trafficking network through Venezuela to Curaçao and the ABC islands, and has announced plans to target corporate media in Colombia. In Toro, armed men entered a house and murdered three women, showing a broader pattern of violence beyond battlefield engagements. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPbE1nRW9qZFBoclIxb2tVTi01aGNZb0tFa0dpc29rME9yN01YX1Zqck5ZbkxPVHVtd1NfWEZmQXdFazJUTHJNcDdvNWdsN1VGOVhBVFUxbnM3RTFxdnV3bEsxQmJXMy1wbXhxUDJHZDZ1Wno4YXE3YXpERXFOTWpNbEloeUVhcjdIQkxhaTE2VnFjTlFyVTEybTZHY1VOblVBS1A4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQOWNEdXlRQ2U1M3Z2aVgzLXk0S1ZPLWRrUi1qVkVEdUhZel9XamI2ZEg1X2VOZ3ZOMTRQYkw3ZW9nWGYzd3IzVlg2U01vblFSVTFOMnpCRk9UN2FfUGgwRjlaam95YWNIeWtsNTk0cVBfLWxtTmFXUlMwUHc5aVpYcTBaemZmaG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNRUxoTG83UlZ0blB4bjQzb1pGZzh3azlqN01nd0RXaVF3eFlXZ253U3V3RS1JaDMta2VYNkp0THdnYjhzQk1CUVo0b3Vsb1NoRXlncW5jTzBaOHBaOTFiMmVCamJnNWxCTVZwM2Rfcmp6WjZkNWREeHJuejhDY3U4SmJTRi1Kbm5WX0ZHY3BNNVNSbWVCWE5OUzE0bFhmaG1GWE1IOXV2V0l5YTFxamVBd05Saw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQZ24yVlA1TlJVLXRodVFEdk8tYTUwNzRYQUZNSzA4OHBXbEdfYjE3aFZ0U0xTeFA3aDBtY2dpTWhmRDNOeGNyUzBZMVN0ckl2eHRHTkhUMnhESDR6bXNocl9iLUFmaXA0T25tMEt3cnJWZ0xmcVFpOC1ja0RoLWhKNlNYamZGNU